We are the Country Western Dance group for UNT students and faculty. Our organization is not a performance group, but rather a teaching/learning group! We teach the basic two-step, advanced spins, line dancing and everything in-between. Teachers vary each week, with officers, alumni, and community members offering instruction on different moves each week. Our club aims to provide a comfortable environment for students and faculty alike to learn country western dance styles as a way to embrace an aspect of Texas culture.

