-- Workshop: 3D Character Series – Step 3: Rigging and Animation
-- Source URL: https://calendar.unt.edu/event/workshop-3d-character-series-step-3-rigging-and-animation
-- Auto-created location: Discovery Park Building, The Spark Makerspace (33.253134, -97.148579)
-- Match reason: auto-created location from ICS coordinates
WITH
